{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":95,"count":35,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L07-2-08\",\"信\",\"信\",\"信\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要到郵局去寄信，也要買一些信封。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào dào yóujú qù jì xìn, yě yào mǎi yīxiē xìnfēng.","english":"I want to go to the post office to mail a letter, and also buy some envelopes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-10","sourceFront":"信封","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我常常用中文給台灣朋友寫信。","pinyin":"Wǒ chángcháng yòng Zhōngwén gěi Táiwān péngyǒu xiě xìn.","english":"I often write letters to Taiwanese friends in Chinese.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-06","sourceFront":"用","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他昨天去逛夜市的時候，信用卡被偷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-19","sourceFront":"信用卡","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我寫信給父母，跟他們說我在台灣很安全，請他們放心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-20","sourceFront":"放心","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我買了幾張當地的明信片，這些是這次旅行很好的紀念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-37","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我相信有專業能力就比較容易找到好工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-20","sourceFront":"相信","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大學給我一封正式的信，通知我得到獎學金了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-21","sourceFront":"通知","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他說的話不一定是真的，你別相信他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-30","sourceFront":"真","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:聽說王先生有很多女朋友？ B:真的嗎？我不信他是這種人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-16","sourceFront":"信","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我希望將來能當一名很棒的導演。 B:我相信只要你不斷地努力，就能夢想成真的！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-22","sourceFront":"夢想成真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付錢的時候，他從皮包裡抽出一張信用卡交給店員","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-11","sourceFront":"抽","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說坐月子時不能洗頭髮，要不然對身體不好，你相信這樣的說法嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-14","sourceFront":"說法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的錢包丟了，裡面有護照、 信用卡，這件事很要緊，得馬上告訴警察","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-17","sourceFront":"要緊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人相信人的命是被決定的， 誰都改變不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-38","sourceFront":"命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我奶奶不會用電腦，每次想跟朋友連絡，不是去郵局寄信就是打家裡的電話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-26","sourceFront":"連絡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"刷卡購物時，店員會先確認你的簽名是不是和信用卡上的相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-12","sourceFront":"確認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張先生滑雪的技巧很好，這次比賽他有信心能夠得到前三名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-29","sourceFront":"信心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小畢本來認為自己的書法寫得很好，但是上次比賽輸了以後，他就失去自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-14","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆收到一封寫滿越南文的信，辦公室沒人看得懂，非找人翻譯不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-18","sourceFront":"非","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母除了教導孩子做人做事的道理，也應該肯定他們的表現，讓他們更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-08","sourceFront":"教導","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得馬小姐找不到工作的原因不是自己的條件不夠好，是他太缺乏自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-17","sourceFront":"缺乏","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電影明星一向很重視自己的穿著，合適的穿著才能讓他們更有品味、更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-05","sourceFront":"一向","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我妹妹的個性太單純了，別人說什麼她都相信，難怪常吃虧","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人信上帝，有人不信。但在東西方的文化中，「上帝」的角色都是很重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-23","sourceFront":"上帝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國留學有不少好處，例如打開視野、增加自信、提高外文程度等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-20","sourceFront":"例如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代人往往以網路傳訊息，代替傳統寫信或打電話的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-15","sourceFront":"往往","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說，這個世界是上帝創造的，你相信嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-15","sourceFront":"創造","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學生：明天就要大學考試了，我很緊張，怕考不好。 老師：你是很優秀的學生，我相信只要盡自己的能力，好好發揮實力，一定沒問題的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-20","sourceFront":"盡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些研究科學的人，對不科學、無法合理解釋的現象都不太相信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-12","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大信覺得這個公司的薪水跟福利都不好，於是決定換工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-14","sourceFront":"於是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"收到別人的信時，應該回信告訴對方收到了，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-23","sourceFront":"回信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我已經退休了，不過還時常跟幾位要好的同事通信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-42","sourceFront":"通信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"前天我收到大學的來信，才知道我被錄取了，真開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-44","sourceFront":"來信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"寄掛號信雖然貴了一點兒，可是比較可靠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-47","sourceFront":"掛號信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都有屬於自己的長處，要對自己更有信心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-15","sourceFront":"長處","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"答應別人的事就要做到，這才是有信用的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-19","sourceFront":"信用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"刷卡買東西很方便，用讀卡機器刷一下信用卡就能付錢了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-08","sourceFront":"刷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"信用卡的正面和背面都有一組號碼，在線上刷卡時用得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-12","sourceFront":"正面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在表演以前準備得越多，上舞臺就越有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-46","sourceFront":"舞台","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"假如失去了人民的信心與支持，國家也會變得不安定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-22","sourceFront":"支持","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過兩段不幸的感情生活，那位女士對愛情已失去了信心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-02","sourceFront":"女士","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們全家都是信基督教的，不論教會舉辦什麼活動，我們都一定去參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-12","sourceFront":"教會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這位郵差的聲音很大，每次他來送信，整條街全都聽見了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-41","sourceFront":"郵差","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有朋友與家人的鼓勵，使他在面對任何困難時都十分自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-47","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國古代的人們相信，當好人碰到危險或困難時，會有神仙到人間來幫助他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-08","sourceFront":"神仙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"迷信的人老是相信一些不真實的迷信，例如：黑貓會帶來不好的運氣、送傘給情人就會分手什麼的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-11","sourceFront":"迷信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"情侶之間如果無法相信彼此，很容易就分手了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-16","sourceFront":"彼此","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) puts their 言(speech) on paper and sends it → a 信(letter) to a friend."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-2-10\",\"信封\",\"信封\",\"信封\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要到郵局去寄信，也要買一些信封。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào dào yóujú qù jì xìn, yě yào mǎi yīxiē xìnfēng.","english":"I want to go to the post office to mail a letter, and also buy some envelopes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-10","sourceFront":"信封","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"信(letter) + 封(seal) → the sealed cover for a letter: envelope."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-1-11\",\"以前\",\"以前\",\"以前\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去上課以前，一定會先在家吃早飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ qù shàngkè yǐqián, yídìng huì xiān zài jiā chī zǎofàn.","english":"Before I go to class, I definitely will first eat breakfast at home.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-11","sourceFront":"以前","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"一個小時以前，他還在這裡。","pinyin":"Yí ge xiǎoshí yǐqián, tā hái zài zhèlǐ.","english":"An hour ago, he was still here.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-11","sourceFront":"小時","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"十分鐘以前我給他打了一個電話。","pinyin":"Shí fēnzhōng yǐqián wǒ gěi tā dǎ le yí ge diànhuà.","english":"Ten minutes ago, I gave him a phone call.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-12","sourceFront":"分鐘","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"結婚以前，他覺得工作最重要，現在他覺得家人最重要。","pinyin":"Jiéhūn yǐqián, tā juéde gōngzuò zuì zhòngyào, xiànzài tā juéde jiārén zuì zhòngyào.","english":"Before getting married, he felt work was most important; now he feels family is most important.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-11","sourceFront":"重要","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"以前妹妹很不喜歡穿裙子，現在她覺得穿裙子很舒服。","pinyin":"Yǐqián mèimei hěn bù xǐhuan chuān qúnzi, xiànzài tā juéde chuān qúnzi hěn shūfu.","english":"In the past, my younger sister really didn't like wearing skirts; now she feels that wearing skirts is very comfortable.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-2-01","sourceFront":"以前","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我每天上學以前，一定先在家吃早飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ měitiān shàngxué yǐqián, yídìng xiān zài jiā chī zǎofàn.","english":"Every day before I go to school, I always eat breakfast at home first.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-09","sourceFront":"上學","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"來台灣學中文以前，我把一些舊書丟了。聽說你的車子丟了。是在哪裡丟的？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-16","sourceFront":"丟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到國外生活以前，得先找租房子的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-14","sourceFront":"生活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他習慣睡覺以前聽一點兒音樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-17","sourceFront":"習慣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我以前沒做過蛋糕，所以想試試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-33","sourceFront":"試","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前沒什麼人喜歡露營，可是最近露營變成了一種流行的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-30","sourceFront":"變成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這裡的交通有很大的改變，比以前方便多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-20","sourceFront":"改變","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看病以前要先掛號，再照號碼進去看醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-12","sourceFront":"掛號","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我參加了愛心服務社以後，想法比以前更成熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這些筆電和平板都比以前的輕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-07","sourceFront":"輕","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末以前，超過三千塊錢的東西都可以打九折，請把握機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-27","sourceFront":"把握","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我在車站遇到以前的同事，他現在是一家保險公司的經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-02","sourceFront":"遇到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的空氣變乾淨了，主要是因為有捷運以後，開車的人比以前少了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-25","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣護照比以前好用得多，去許多國家旅行都不需要簽證了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-33","sourceFront":"簽證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說發生大地震以前，小動物會亂跑、亂叫，這是很自然的現象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-18","sourceFront":"現象","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"去朋友家以前，一定要約好時間才去，這是做人的基本禮貌","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-22","sourceFront":"基本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小簡今天遇到以前的女朋友，跟她喝了咖啡才回家，但不敢跟太太說實話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-33","sourceFront":"實話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到新公司報到以前，應先把個人的態度及觀念調整好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-04","sourceFront":"報到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這份文件很急，請你下班以前傳真給對方公司。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-36","sourceFront":"傳真","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前人們常用磁帶來存電腦的重要資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-14","sourceFront":"磁帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"做任何事以前要先想清楚，這麼做會有什麼後果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-51","sourceFront":"後果","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他以前化學成績常不及格，沒想到現在卻是有名的化學教授。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-05","sourceFront":"化學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前我的小學老師總是親切地教導我們，讓我到現在還是很懷念她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-08","sourceFront":"懷念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上臺報告以前要把資料準備好，以免到時候手忙腳亂的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-37","sourceFront":"上臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在表演以前準備得越多，上舞臺就越有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-46","sourceFront":"舞台","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的腰越來越胖，現在買的褲子尺寸比以前大了兩號。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-18","sourceFront":"腰","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前學校規定女學生的髮型都要一樣，而且長度不能超過耳朵。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-18","sourceFront":"髮型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這只箱子是以前奶奶留給我的，對我來說是很珍貴的禮物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-36","sourceFront":"只","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這一屆的學生絕大部分都在畢業以前找到了工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-04","sourceFront":"屆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"以前 means 'in the past; before'. 前(front) shows the past lies in front of you in time."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-05\",\"好玩\",\"好玩\",\"好玩\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"友美說她想去，我還沒決定去不去。燈會好玩嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi shuō tā xiǎng qù, wǒ háiméi juédìng qù bú qù. Dēnghuì hǎowán ma?","english":"Youmei wants to see it. But I haven’t decided to go. Is the Lantern Carnival fun?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"好玩 means fun or interesting: 好(good) + 玩(play) → a good time playing."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-04\",\"這次\",\"這次\",\"这次\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我跟朋友這次去英國玩了八天七夜。","pinyin":"Wǒ gēn péngyou zhè cì qù Yīngguó wán le bā tiān qī yè.","english":"This time I went to England with a friend and played for eight days and seven nights.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-24","sourceFront":"夜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"上次我們吃牛肉麵，這次也吃牛肉麵，下次吃別的吧。","pinyin":"Shàng cì wǒmen chī niúròumiàn, zhè cì yě chī niúròumiàn, xià cì chī bié de ba.","english":"Last time we ate beef noodles, this time we're also eating beef noodles; next time let's eat something else.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-06","sourceFront":"下次","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這次去荷蘭旅行的費用很高，因為車票很貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-24","sourceFront":"費用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師很滿意大家這次期中考的成績。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次期中考，大家都考得很好，老師覺得很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的旅行很順利，沒有什麼問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-10","sourceFront":"順利","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的旅遊真有意思，我以後還想多去幾個地方玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-07","sourceFront":"旅遊","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次考試的分數沒有我想的那麼差。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-20","sourceFront":"差","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次考試很難，可是大家的分數都不低，好奇怪！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-21","sourceFront":"低","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動辦得很成功，大家都玩得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-23","sourceFront":"成功","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我買了幾張當地的明信片，這些是這次旅行很好的紀念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-37","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次期末的筆試不太難，大家都考得不錯。今天早上考筆試的時候，我寫得太慢了，所以沒寫完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-21","sourceFront":"筆試","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次數學期末考的筆試很難，我有四題寫錯了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-28","sourceFront":"題","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他這次到美國去出差，幫公司處理了不少問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-08","sourceFront":"出差","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我這次考試的成績不太好，下次我會更加努力的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-25","sourceFront":"更加","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese"