14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-26\",\"地點\",\"地點\",\"地点\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"公司的生產部門這個月規劃了員工旅遊，有三個不同地點讓大家選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-02","sourceFront":"規劃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"背包客為了解省交通費，經常搭別人的車到下一個地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-01","sourceFront":"背包客","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家民宿的地點實在太偏僻了，除了路不好走，附近也沒人住，想找個人問路都難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-27","sourceFront":"偏僻","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司向每位員工發出健檢通知，上面寫著檢查時間、地點和需要注意的事情","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-19","sourceFront":"發出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我伯伯在鄉下有一塊土地，可是地點很偏僻，想賣也賣不掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-27","sourceFront":"土地","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"淡水的夕陽很美，如此的美麗風景，是約會的極佳地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-26","sourceFront":"如此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-17\",\"滿足\",\"滿足\",\"满足\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 滿(full) and 足(foot): 滿足 means satisfied."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-2-25\",\"紅蛋\",\"紅蛋\",\"红蛋\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 紅(red) and 蛋(egg): 紅蛋 means red egg."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-20\",\"帥\",\"帥\",\"帅\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小張不僅長得帥，穿著也很有品味，所以很多人都以為他是明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-20","sourceFront":"帥","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:喲，你今天怎麼穿得這麼帥？ B:下午要參加公司茶會，得穿得正式一些？ A:那下次跟我約會時，也要這麼穿呦！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-03","sourceFront":"喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人覺得留鬍子比較帥，我倒是覺得留了鬍子看起來比較老。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-06","sourceFront":"鬍子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Stationed upon a defensive 阜(mound), the commander straightens his silk 巾(cloth) looking dashing and 帥(handsome)."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-28\",\"範圍\",\"範圍\",\"范围\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家電腦公司本來只服務亞洲地區的民眾，現在服務範圍已經擴大到歐洲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-28","sourceFront":"範圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 範(pattern) and 圍(surround): 範圍 means range, scope."},{"key":"[\"B4L03-2-07\",\"算帐\",\"算帳\",\"算帐\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"拿到購物收據，要是發現算錯帳了，就請店員再算一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-07","sourceFront":"算帳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-14\",\"一手\",\"一手\",\"一手\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個廚師很有一手，能用一條魚做出五道菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-14","sourceFront":"一手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-57\",\"大地\",\"大地\",\"大地\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"大地就像我們的母親一樣，一直保護著我們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-57","sourceFront":"大地","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個外國人第一次來臺灣就碰上了大地震，讓他非常難忘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-14","sourceFront":"碰上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"九二一大地震發生得太突然，不少民眾因為來不及反應，而被困在屋裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-08","sourceFront":"反應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這場大地震發生後不久，軍人就立刻趕到了災區，協助救災工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-26","sourceFront":"協助","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有人說發生大地震以前，小動物會亂跑、亂叫，這是很自然的現象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-18","sourceFront":"現象","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"發生大地震後，民眾都發揮愛心，主動提供救災的相關用品給災民。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-09","sourceFront":"相關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"大地震過後才幾天，這個災區的民眾除了收到許多衣服和食物，還收到五千萬元，讓大家又驚訝又感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-15","sourceFront":"驚訝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個小孩在這場大地震中失去了親人，實在太可憐了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-36","sourceFront":"失去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"九二一大地震時，臺灣人發揮了互相幫助的精神，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-33","sourceFront":"發揮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-31\",\"哎喲\",\"哎喲\",\"哎哟\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"哎喲，已經半夜一點多了！我們就別再加班寫產品計畫了，等明天再繼續吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-31","sourceFront":"哎喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-2-01\",\"攀\",\"攀\",\"攀\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我沒有帶大門的鑰匙，不得不攀牆進去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-01","sourceFront":"攀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-03\",\"無論\",\"無論\",\"无论\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"無論發生什麼事，她都會跟父母商量，並參考他們的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-03","sourceFront":"無論","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"無論做錯事或出差錯，任何人都應主動負起責任。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-23","sourceFront":"出","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"照顧還沒成年的孩子是父母應盡的責任，無論如何，既然生了就該養他、教導他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-25","sourceFront":"無論如何","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"錯誤通常來自粗心，因此無論事情大小都該用心處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-13","sourceFront":"來自","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-2-08\",\"国立\",\"國立\",\"国立\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這所國立大學獨特的教育風格吸引了不少國外學生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-08","sourceFront":"國立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"國立博物館正在展覽公元三百年左右的古文物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-01","sourceFront":"公元","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-31\",\"一口气\",\"一口氣\",\"一口气\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"難得今天有空，我們不如一口氣解決工作上所有的問題吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-31","sourceFront":"一口氣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"緊張的時候試著慢慢呼吸，吸一口氣，再慢慢呼出來，可以讓你輕鬆一點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-34","sourceFront":"吸","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-2-23\",\"团结\",\"團結\",\"团结\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"團體活動中，不團結就失去了合作的意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-23","sourceFront":"團結","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"介\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 人(person) raises both arms to guide a crowd → 介(agent)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"友\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 𠂇(left hand) reaches out, and 又(again) a hand grips back — meeting again and again as 友(friend)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"問題\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"問(ask) + 題(question) → the question you ask is a 問題, meaning question or problem."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"始\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 女(woman) steps onto the 台(platform) first → 始(begin)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"書法\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"書(book) + 法(method) → the method of writing characters, meaning calligraphy."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"淋\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 氵(water) fills the 林(forest) leaves → soaked: 淋(drench)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"秋\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 禾(grain) field takes the 火(fire) sky → golden 秋(autumn)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"立\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The 亠(lid) and 丷(horns) rise from the 一(one) ground line — 立(stand)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"蓋\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Grass 艹(grass) on a roof covers a house; the 盍(what?) inside asks why. → 蓋(build a house)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"蛋\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 疋(roll) covers a 虫(insect) snug and warm → a hidden 蛋(egg)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"請\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"She wraps her 言(speech) in 青(green) silk and bows → 請(please)."}]}
